p-with-float-switch48054138936.jpg\"/></span></li><li><span><img alt=\"\" bimg=\"/uploads/201816806/built-in-submersible-pump-with-float-switch59305048630.jpg\" onmousemove=\"preview(this);\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/built-in-submersible-pump-with-float-switch59305048630.jpg\"/></span></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">Built-in Submersible Pump with Float Switch</h1>\n<p>This product built-in submersible pump with float switch is designed precisely by our technician. Our products have been chosen by customers from all over the world because of the reasonable price, trustful quality, and advanced design, which help us to win most clients’ praise and trust.</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"52163783\"/></p><p><strong>built-in submersible pump with float switch</strong><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241049588783131.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image004(001).jpg\"/></p><p>This product built-in submersible pump with float switch is designed precisely by our technician. Our products have been chosen by customers from all over the world because of the reasonable price, trustful quality, and advanced design, which help us to win most clients’ praise and trust.</p><p><strong>1. Specification</strong></p><p><strong>Insulation class</strong>: B</p><p><strong>Protection grade:</strong> IP68</p><p><strong>Sing-phase:</strong> 220v-240v/50 Hz</p><p><strong>Three-phase: </strong>380v-415v/50 Hz</p><p><strong>Maximum fluid temperature: </strong>35ºC</p><p><strong>Applications</strong></p><p>1. For sewage or dirty water</p><p>2.For domestic use, civil and industrial applications</p><p>Warranty: 12 months FREE warranty</p><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image005.jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241051411644411.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image003(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241049526664011.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></strong></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Copper Motor<br/></p><p><img alt=\"image006(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241052115595960.jpg\"/></p><p>·Lower temperature for the motor</p><p>·Longer lifespan</p><p><br/></p></td><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Mechanical Seal</p><p><img alt=\"image007(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241052196458480.jpg\"/></p><p>·Super-high precision Carborundum Graphite mechanical seal</p><p>·Oil, water and sand proof</p><p><br/></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Stator</p><p><img alt=\"image008(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241052291922773.jpg\"/></p><p>·Keep power durable and efficiency</p><p>·Continuous operating guaranteed</p><p><br/></p></td><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Stud/Nut/Screws</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241052361686648.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image009(001).jpg\"/><img alt=\"image010(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241052409331527.jpg\"/></p><p>·Material: S/S 304</p><p>·Rust proof</p><p><br/></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4. Company Profile</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241055444626267.jpg\"/></strong></p><p>TAIZHOU JIADI PUMP INDUSTRY CO., LTD. was built in 1998 by Mr. Chen in Zhejiang province. We are capable of manufacturing various submersible and clean water pumps with functions as all kinds of voltage, different frequency, special flow, stranded use, full head, corrosion-resistant, sediment suction, multi sealed, low pressure start. JIADI complies with careful selection, excellent quality, strict management, good service to strive to produce better products and provide better services in good faith. </p><p><strong>5. Advantages: </strong></p><p>·Good design and strict production technics;</p><p>·Adopt stainless steel material, high mechanical strength, use safety and good sealing;</p><p>·Cable adopt special material, it have high oil, acid, corrosive resistance.</p><p>·The ON or OFF switch control signal without any error is very reliable and stable,;</p><p>·Strict tests include water test, outgas test and performance test, ect.</p><p><strong>6. Why Choose Us</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image012(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241056443940979.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong>1. Tight sealing</strong></p><p>JIADI 125SC4 series submersible pump adopts dual-seal motor. With optimized design, the seal system is safe and reliable, preventing leakage of fluids inside and outside the motor.</p><p><strong>2. Hard and durable</strong></p><p>JIADI 125SC4 series submersible pump has sturdy and durable cast iron body, which has been processed with advanced technology to resist corrosion.</p><p><strong>3. Convenient to use</strong></p><p>It is small in size, taking little floor space, so you don’t need to build a pump house for it. It has no special requirements on well casings. It will be easy for you to install.</p><p><strong>7. Exhibition Show</strong></p><p><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241057373424423.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image013(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>8. Packing and Delivery</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241057386652964.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image014(001).jpg\"/></p><p>Packaging Details：Carton packing with plastic foam/Wooden box</p><p>Port: Ningbo, Shanghai, Lianyungang</p><p>Lead Time: 20 to 30 days</p><p>Shipment: By s